{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1e440713-8aa8-821f-9041-479b8c4ba16a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T12:13:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tito Tavares",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:11:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:11:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey, Luis. Yeah, hi. My name's Tito Tavares. I'm calling about a parking ticket, but it's my mother's, actually. It's her car."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:11:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is she there with you, or are you handling it for her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:11:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm handling it. She's not a phone person. So the ticket says resident permit parking only, right? But she's got the sticker. It's on the windshield, bottom corner, passenger side. I looked at it myself this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:11:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And where was the car, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:11:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Out front of her place yesterday, with all the snow coming in. It turned to rain overnight, so everything's a mess out there. Anyway, I don't get it. If she's got the sticker, why'd they write it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:11:57-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be a few things. The sticker might be for a different zone than the street she was on, or it might be expired, or the officer couldn't see it through the snow on the glass. Does the ticket list a violation code or a zone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, hold on. [pause] It says something with a number. Zone... I don't know, I'm not sure what I'm looking at. Is the zone the same as the number on the sticker?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually, yeah. Read me both and I'll tell you if they match."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the sticker I'd have to go look at again. I'm at work. Can I call back on that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. In the meantime, you can contest it. That's a separate step from paying it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And, so, she's never had a ticket before. Never. Is there any way the fine gets waived the first time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a review process, and a clean record helps. I can't promise it, but it's worth asking for in the appeal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:12:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay, that's something. Wait, so is the appeal the same as contesting? I thought those were two different things."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same thing, different words. Confusing, I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'm still a little lost, but I'll get the sticker number. Hey, random question. Is it still bright out where you are? We've got no windows in here, I lost track."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's gray but bright. Wet out there. Looks like noon because it is noon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, okay. Thanks, Luis. I'll call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T12:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Take care."
    }
  ],
